# WHITELIST. Everything is ignored unless listed below.
# Only our own source, sheets (structure + status, never game data), docs and license texts are tracked.
# Never tracked: the ISO, anything extracted or decompiled from it, caches, the OpenKH filename list
# (downloaded by `kh2 fetch-names` into local/), build output, screenshots.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.lock
!/README.md
!/CREDITS.md
!/LICENSE-MIT
!/LICENSE-APACHE
!/rust-toolchain.toml
!/crates/
!/sheets/
!/docs/
!/third_party/

# Inside tracked folders: still never commit binaries or game-derived files.
*.iso
*.bin
*.img
*.idx
*.elf
*.png
*.dds
*.wav
*.exe
*.dll
target/
**/local/
# The Save menu's slot files (progress::save_dir; KH2_SAVE_DIR may name any folder, it is the user's own).
local/saves/
saves/
